      <!-- phase: Implementation; The integrated, runnable simulation setup. Mandatory from CL2 (Quantitative Predictions: a specified accuracy requirement, checked against an implemented model and test case). CL1/CL2 columns inherit the CSP (STMD) obligation of the same-named step; CL3/CL4 as derived for the CMP. -->
