    <rule id="CMP-MTMD-CL4-DecideModelingObjectiveFulfillment" context="//mtmd:ModelingTaskMetaData//mtmd:DecideModelingObjectiveFulfillment">
      <!-- phase: Fulfillment; Signed statement whether the modeling objective was met. Mandatory at every level (spine of the record). CL1/CL2 columns inherit the CSP (STMD) obligation of the same-named step; CL3/CL4 as derived for the CMP. -->
